  "bodyHash": "032f08117f82c1fb",
  "content": "\n\n<a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/bisect\"><img width=100% src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702795/bisect.png\"></a>\n<center>\n    <iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/l2P5w9AkEiQ\" width=\"100%\"></iframe>\n</center>\n\n<center>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquamirae-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Fabric\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Fabric-213f5c?style=for-the-badge\"></a> \n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ob-aquamirae\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Forge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Forge-213f5c?style=for-the-badge\"></a>\n    <a href=\"https://discord.gg/jSHHJSUWdY\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/899742852681191444?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white&label=&labelColor=231C25&color=3d215c\"></a>\n</center>\n\n<br>\n\n### <center>Aquamirae 为你的世界增添了一片冰封的海洋生物群系——冰层之上是迷宫般的冰原，冰层之下则是阴森的沉船墓地。在探寻科妮莉亚船长命运、于冰面之下躲避恐怖威胁的同时，探索其独特的生态系统、成长路线、环境氛围与背景故事吧。</center>\n\n<br>\n\n<center><img width=80% src=https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769699368/header/features.png></center>\n\n<br>\n\n### “ 那片曾无边无际的海洋，其波涛曾由狂风自深渊掀起，也曾见证勇敢航海者与令人畏惧的掠夺者舰队的航迹，如今却被冰雪牢牢禁锢。\n\n### 时间仿佛在此凝固……那些不幸的船只被永久封冻在无情冰层之下，与此同时，可怖的生物也从深渊爬出，重见天日。凛冽暴风雪中，唯有零星号角声宣告着仍期盼救援者的存在。究竟是什么力量，让这片曾经汪洋恣肆的大海发生如此剧变？ ”\n\n<br>\n\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td width=\"60%\">\n            <img width=\"100%\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/k23mNPhZ/images/28676dc18ec5f5acaabcd64c3886a45d30b50607.jpeg\">\n        </td>\n        <td width=\"40%\">\n            <h1>冰之迷宫</h1>\n            <p>一座冰封的迷宫矗立于沉船墓地之上，构成了一个充满危险与秘密的双层生物群系。探索蜿蜒的走廊、坍塌的甲板、隐秘的密室以及深埋于冰层之下的无声残骸。</p>\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n\n<br>\n\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td width=\"40%\">\n            <h1>建筑与氛围</h1>\n            <p>从废弃营地到巨大的冰冻残骸，生物群系的每个角落都提供了探索的空间与待解的故事。定制音乐、诡异的氛围音效与飘落的雪花，将每一次探险化作一场沉浸式的氛围之旅。</p>\n        </td>\n        <td width=\"60%\">\n            <img width=\"100%\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769701551/showcase-2.png\">\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n\n<br>\n\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td width=\"60%\">\n            <img width=\"100%\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769701551/showcase-3.png\">\n        </td>\n        <td width=\"40%\">\n            <h1>冰下生物</h1>\n            <p>来自深渊的可怖造物已浮出水面，迫使当地的掠夺者舰队隐匿行踪。这些生物并非仅仅栖息于迷宫之中——它们会从冰层下方涌出，将任何胆敢靠近者驱赶至最偏远的角落以求自保。</p>\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n\n<br>\n\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td width=\"40%\">\n            <h1>科妮莉亚船长</h1>\n            <p>这位幽灵船长以流畅的动作与致命的技能守护着沉船墓地的核心。她的悲惨往事通过环境细节与她留下的宝藏逐渐展开。</p>\n        </td>\n        <td width=\"60%\">\n            <img width=\"100%\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769701551/showcase-4.png\">\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n\n<br>\n\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td width=\"60%\">\n            <img width=\"100%\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769701551/showcase-5.png\">\n        </td>\n        <td width=\"40%\">\n            <h1>宝藏与自定义</h1>\n            <p>在生物群系各处发现独特的武器、附带特殊加成的护甲套装以及稀有的饰品。支持完整的配置文件设置，你可以精细调整生成规则、难度、战利品及各项功能，使其完美契合你的世界。</p>\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n\n<br>\n\n<center><img width=80% src=https://i.imgur.com/gaxlKkX.png></center>\n\n<br>\n\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td width=\"15%\">\n            <img width=\"100%\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cCXV545X/b5b15a5fdab90a6075408aae2ed1c204dbcf0043.png\">\n        </td>\n        <td width=\"40%\">\n            <h1><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/aquamirae-delight\">Aquamirae Delight</a> by tinfoilknight</h1>\n            <p>Aquamirae Delight 是一款为 Farmer's Delight 和 Aquamirae 提供兼容性的模组。它在保持两个模组主题、食材与玩法风格一致的前提下，引入了新菜品与强化配方，保留了原汁原味的类原版体验。</p>\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n\n<br>\n\n<center><img width=80% src=https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769699408/header/more-from-obscuria.png></center>\n\n<br>\n\n<center>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/aquamirae\"><img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702990/aquamirae.png\" width=\"45%\" /></a> \n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/obscure-tooltips\"><img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702990/obscure-tooltips.png\" width=\"45%\" /></a>\n</center>\n<center>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/pillager-caravans\"><img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702990/pillager-caravans.png\" width=\"45%\" /></a> \n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/ars-elixirum\"><img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702990/ars-elixirum.png\" width=\"45%\" /></a>\n</center>\n<center>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/accents\"><img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/quXJZzx.png\" width=\"45%\" /></a> \n  <img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702990/blank.png\" width=\"45%\" />\n</center>\n<center>\n  <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Obscuria\"><img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702990/patreon.png\" width=\"90%\" /></a>\n</center>\n<center>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/jSHHJSUWdY\"><img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702990/discord.png\" width=\"90%\" /></a>\n</center>",
